WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Government agencies really investigated remote viewing.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A 1984 session used a target sheet naming ancient Mars.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A transcript records what was said. It does not verify the scene described.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The 1995 review found poor intelligence usefulness and disputed interpretation.
